direction: down

question: Start with the responsibility

map: {
  grid-columns: 1

  work: "What should happen?\nRunnable / Callable<V>"
  execution: "Where and how should it run?\nThread / ExecutorService / virtual threads"
  results: "How do results flow?\nFuture<V> / CompletableFuture<T>"
  safety: "What state is shared?\nsynchronized / volatile / Lock / atomics\nConcurrentHashMap / BlockingQueue"
  coordination: "Who may proceed?\nSemaphore / CountDownLatch / CyclicBarrier"
  computation: "Can the computation split?\nForkJoinPool / parallel streams"
}

question -> map: choose the problem before the class
